:"list","items":[{"text":"Marine propulsion"},{"text":"Alternative marine fuels"},{"text":"Hydrogen/ammonia propulsion"},{"text":"Marine batteries"},{"text":"Hybrid propulsion"},{"text":"Engine efficiency"},{"text":"Waste-heat recovery"},{"text":"Marine emissions"},{"text":"Autonomous ships"},{"text":"AI-based predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Marine robotics"},{"text":"Energy-efficient ship design"}]}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Career Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the 2040s, the Marine Engineer is likely to operate in a much more automated environment."},{"type":"p","text":"Future responsibilities may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitoring autonomous machinery"},{"text":"Managing hybrid propulsion"},{"text":"Optimising alternative-fuel systems"},{"text":"Interpreting AI maintenance predictions"},{"text":"Managing digital twins"},{"text":"Remote machinery diagnostics"},{"text":"Energy optimisation"},{"text":"Cybersecurity awareness"},{"text":"Environmental compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible future roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chief Engineer"},{"text":"Fleet Technical Manager"},{"text":"Digital Fleet Manager"},{"text":"Marine Energy Manager"},{"text":"Smart Ship Engineer"},{"text":"Maritime Automation Specialist"},{"text":"Alternative-Fuel Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Technical Superintendent"},{"text":"Fleet Performance Manager"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Heat transfer"},{"text":"Mechanical systems"},{"text":"Diesel engines"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Boilers"},{"text":"Refrigeration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marine"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ship machinery"},{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Auxiliary systems"},{"text":"Engine-room operations"},{"text":"Maritime safety"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Emergency 